From 00aa668570f876ec92238c11981e8cbfa7e389b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:39:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move Experience/Enhancement incompatibility to the
 Enhancement admin page

Incompatibility is now configured from Enhancement -> Incompatible
Experiences (blacklist, default compatible) instead of from the
Experience side. Adds enhancement_content.incompatible_experiences,
backfills it from the old experience_content.incompatible_enhancements
column via inversion, then drops the old column so there is a single
source of truth. buildRendererData.ts's enhancement filter reads from
the new column; the multi-day exception is unchanged.
